{"3351040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Happy Puppy", "steam_appid": 3351040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/14593e1b30400a2c0d2849fb447bc80e.avif?t=1756832544\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras_big/14593e1b30400a2c0d2849fb447bc80e.avif?t=1756832544 width=800 height=300 /></span><strong>CREATE AND EXPAND YOUR DREAM GARDEN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a cozy garden filled with vibrant crops, playful puppies, and charming decorations. Choose from a variety of decorative items and toys to make your garden lively!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.webm?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.mp4?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARE FOR ADORABLE PUPPIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, clean, play, and care for your puppies to keep them happy and healthy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.webm?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.mp4?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A THRIVING, JOYFUL HAVEN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden, improve its design, and grow your farm. Attract more puppies and turn your space into a lively, heartwarming paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/da0b7e377302a398eebe72abf39cd168.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/da0b7e377302a398eebe72abf39cd168.webm?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/da0b7e377302a398eebe72abf39cd168.mp4?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT PUPPIES OF ALL KINDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome a variety of unique puppies. Grow your collection and create lasting memories with your furry friends!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/14593e1b30400a2c0d2849fb447bc80e.avif?t=1756832544\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras_big/14593e1b30400a2c0d2849fb447bc80e.avif?t=1756832544 width=800 height=300 /></span><strong>CREATE AND EXPAND YOUR DREAM GARDEN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a cozy garden filled with vibrant crops, playful puppies, and charming decorations. Choose from a variety of decorative items and toys to make your garden lively!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.webm?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/ebf647d33c719f90a3c3978449e74710.mp4?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARE FOR ADORABLE PUPPIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, clean, play, and care for your puppies to keep them happy and healthy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.webm?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/33a78d331ddf6065bebe085598490555.mp4?t=1756832544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A THRIVING, JOYFUL HAVEN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden, improve its design, and grow your farm. Attract more puppies and turn your space into a lively, heartwarming paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351040/extras/da0b7e377302a398eebe72abf39cd168.poster.avif?t=1756832544\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akam